From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: GDmio <zhalin66@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 23:36:47 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] BlueOS: SetupWizard: compact welcome with language picker
 replaces Google's

Google SUW starts before the user is unlocked; the partner (this app) was not
direct boot aware, so SUW fell back to its own script and showed its welcome.

- WelcomeActivity, the language picker, DeviceInfoActivity and PartnerReceiver
  are direct boot aware; WelcomeActivity also answers Google's OEM_PRE_SETUP.
- wizard_script: the BlueOS welcome goes straight to check_user_unlock.
- Welcome page: logo higher, normal-size buttons, language button that opens
  LocaleActivity and returns (BlueOSLocalePickerActivity).

Change-Id: If30528333abf48ac48274d6e19a4af386b61abc5
